      "vod_content": "Content advisory: Racist remarks.\n\nAcross several sequences, a television news journalist interviews passersby for their views about whether the Frank Putnam Flint Memorial fountain in Los Angeles should be torn down, primarily  focusing on its maintenance needs, and also with reference to an incident in which a person had drowned in the fountain. Interviewees express a range of remarks, accents, and speech performances, not all of which relate to the fountain and some of which contain racist remarks. The interviewer bypasses potential Black interview subjects.\n\nreel notes: \n\"Mag Sound - TV interview Monument\"",
